    },
    {
      "id": "cc857211aac3a05469b216e3dc44c8b657e2160ac45540a85ae04eb79885f068",
      "text": "Ask AIHero Bot",
      "hash": "506d61175461d8d3f3d8aa625b0a7a0cd5985a6c84efb826ea77fcacfa2d4e58"
    },
    {
      "id": "967b053969c7e0a8ca9a87aab429f7da0515bf5e2141bea571b2669cb7e4eeb8",
      "text": "The Map",
      "hash": "030205671760759a2cda42e60c43efd600f9832fdad4e5cb2b1e18fbd786467d"
    },
    {
      "id": "8f592768f9d5c3daeef22b88a971ae2765a054e42ae52b7754786dba0d8cbfba",
      "text": "What would you like to do with AI coding?",
      "hash": "43081592a363f606db23fbebf095afa98e03d587c4da22bdb0b29fc075b715db"
    },
    {
      "id": "4bdda0b6254276a6ac0178b60785231ff649d9bac6e41653269802fb08419af4",
      "text": "Pick the question that sounds like you. Each one opens onto the articles, videos, and skills that answer it, in the order they make sense.",
      "hash": "35ce24e51c8ad47e8b4dcde78802e51512a22c42540b336b323002ea56f2d97a"
    },
    {
      "id": "095ecfa9b2a8eef0ca8e2d9eac51d8bbe52eabebb2e3ac90e35cd44d2406c094",
      "text": "How do I get started?",
      "hash": "c69a5211cd6cd0f4f357b922d8efd6a43e358555d84ee3dd390c12cb72ee100a"
    },
    {
      "id": "1c3d094e5b0ac9b23495161387128565eb214e870064d75634918da3fea9319e",
      "text": "How can I get AI to write code like me?",
      "hash": "fdadf642baf8236ec4d0194d03905e83d54e79ef2388619d5f8d365972846062"
    },
    {
      "id": "ee46ea45c3182d198becd764ae68d2a7c695188349eba5565f67e5cca634f7da",
      "text": "How can I get the most out of AI coding?",
      "hash": "68684deb15523f93efa02785d135cc8c52092a3b4e66804794017d851a312cd7"
    },
    {
      "id": "7c39aad8fff809d3f2c270b9a5e04713870f0a20ffc2893bb8bd1604fd25efd4",
      "text": "What's new?",
      "hash": "623aab5c4dfa719932006c292084dab024941989723760ea686c2e46ac2ee44a"
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8c4762d00fb0d319a7f519444403cea4279dcdf20014a72724a4c530b4bc12",
      "text": "Never written code? Start here — what an LLM actually is, what it can do for you, and why there's never been a better time to build your own software.",
      "hash": "9923c7252660403de3b6946649e5e5ae8eede758d4d7052c7977dfb224c7870d"
    },
    {
      "id": "b7701b45899b07eabe67e1459707b8c2f0b2ee94a1ef5622f46db350341f1ca0",
      "text": "Article · 6 min read",
      "hash": "7ae580c148d942f43333e8d2167ab7f6a0ed57cd2fb39a8fadd9fb24c2b457a3"
    },
    {
      "id": "6ba4252a9efed14077e7f2eafc3b1e3e87d55ef0101d0203633710f73bd68a7d",
      "text": "What Is An LLM?",
      "hash": "1d25e4befcc73aaee8c08564f2c7480c24d819ba956e8194e5a6bbe0e34b42a8"
    },
    {
      "id": "9089c1509403c72aba4fa14d31e6a2cd74c5193eb3d70b93a2e176b979871818",
      "text": "Discover the basics of Large Language Models (LLM), their structure, operation, and creation process. Perfect for beginners ready to dive into AI.",
      "hash": "5b0896cb80221a50e2defa68fbcabda11e84f6af3ff49e4d7de3071fe7ab6929"
    },
    {
      "id": "469a0b121fe80792d82fb0853d78ed0dcda4139da6c1aff04b387a0667d4bee0",
      "text": "Video",
      "hash": "d534be829e32196b4d1e53b67103cf1e376b1d60071857572598c196abfefbc6"
    },
    {
      "id": "5248bb0e8a98f625b2827b555445285293e8b10cc7e51d890cd73fe8dbb7a6f8",
      "text": "What Can You Use LLM's For?",
      "hash": "58dcd0c1183a448e734775d6fd0342aca5b8d534d20c623a5e15958a8ddd4fd0"
    },
    {
      "id": "5880545c054898c3c22c2d2e2aeae7ad37b133c85134808aeaf37712f1c6d41c",
      "text": "Discover when to use LLMs for data tasks like structuring and classification, and when to opt for deterministic systems.",
      "hash": "cc535db479f82807922e33f68f7f1fe03f1062466deab59986be029bbedc8adf"
    },
    {
      "id": "7a164fd416568a3a178b989a7b636951cf4af15b5e3be9430c1d5cc9cffc0488",
      "text": "What Is An Agent?",
      "hash": "4363a0eaad32a30e59832dae65d5ce46e94404b308512b2a6a68c13044d2919e"
    },
    {
      "id": "dde182e377924f5c298a48a0e471534901197d08ab311546ae34265ed121181e",
      "text": "Discover the power of agents vs workflows in LLM systems. Learn how agents improvise and workflows optimize for predictable, repeatable tasks.",
      "hash": "fdb63203791f5611615bca7e4f2f2bfb66d7743c34319c9b41fe7edbe460208f"
    },
    {
      "id": "f527f0a74b7ce4c65d7cebad737066ee79c82fdc85256858f5276f963b27b3a0",
      "text": "Personal software is INSANE in the age of AI",
      "hash": "81634f3dc1c8467ebe5925ba88e5bafeccb90ac2a80ac3db4018d839a4a7b743"
    },
    {
      "id": "81612f6fd75674670a93884c027e82879c1b338ca83c59e94d19757a9f337c23",
      "text": "Don't delegate your thinking to LLMs. Use AI for grunt work in personal software built for your workflow. Keep the judgment for yourself.",
      "hash": "730c5d1cf614ecfcb92ce437779140981a9cb1bf6a69c06ea78d97c7192b2230"
    },
    {
      "id": "69092e8441f1ad3f4024226f8a05fcd8902b1828472cb5706df1cbf07a7bfab5",
      "text": "More fundamentals",
      "hash": "d2b8922c3b9e2594c0218de80050eff646618b74ee0630611019ce8441bc1fc0"
    },
    {
      "id": "0f0589c4fe82320b7f189085c88eecf30d49c30ae115f9094ef96f3d39d57712",
      "text": "You can already code — now get the agent coding to your standard. Set up the rules, the context, and the workflow so its output reads like yours.",
      "hash": "b215aec6491b81fede2ec2047d473a4dcd70a646f2fc42480886fafda021dad0"
    },
    {
      "id": "3d4b433c86ce007af481487974b054cf8e38f2e5aa35a9ab6b4fad400c878fd7",
      "text": "Article · 5 min read",
      "hash": "0ef2eb789f1bdd1ead378588eecc2a21c19ed08b87c0e7717705b36165d3597f"
    },
    {
      "id": "4f16bd050822b224f24269f4ddcda530ab503aec202782b4abe32bd0154beee6",
      "text": "The AI Engineer Mindset",
      "hash": "4cecfc761ad682ecad4c15da33f30edeeae171b6fae7e9b2473d35315877d59e"
    },
    {
      "id": "eccad4d0de890d1dce582562e81c4fb86ee3b142f8ff90e8e761d55cdc9f5f52",
      "text": "Learn how to build successful LLM applications by defining clear success metrics, and creating a data-driven culture of continuous improvement.",
      "hash": "02ecdd3a3757c036153f2cee64b1e2607642a9a7191df28163c403e926d02735"
    },
    {
      "id": "3990c1bec492f6e48d64f82cf52725684924ace9e4230b8f8328c0576c9c4600",
      "text": "Article · 7 min read",
      "hash": "8993e5483e776e1d3f97ebc6ef952b6370de588bbe9bb9d0a2fdd7d8e6bcee79"
    },
    {
      "id": "e6d3e79217308cd1d50e2c0a8ee47930c2b72a7179b2b124102d0d149b3ae73d",
      "text": "Learn how to optimize your AGENTS.md file for AI coding agents. Master progressive disclosure, keep instructions focused, and maximize agent performance.",
      "hash": "64911cacef4fc5519600ebcdf7234d51c541c208299e1e40c575f0bb1e76212b"
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae40996f39fb75e2236899746bf67baff8b9011f9217c5e0cb9ab179d854b2",
      "text": "How To Make Codebases AI Agents Love",
      "hash": "90591491b0c0629055e1bdb086a7689081d3f8adf919831d810e245f1d6084cc"
    },
    {
      "id": "0f489ee2f76bdc7022b779856045422d1a1100d3d2c85944bb4eb66ea5e9986c",
      "text": "Learn how deep modules and proper codebase architecture make AI coding more effective. Master software design principles for AI-ready codebases.",
      "hash": "eeb8ae5ecf3d35091e35263c0661f5f97159ea77e2adddc0d4f09066b01bfdd6"
    },
    {
      "id": "8ff76c8c230e159fd01d2ac8b976fafac9b56ef27dae98e9d92178bc70020b84",
      "text": "Article",
      "hash": "29d94922512b93e8d81ffb4c721e52afd32e80d952ebe753ea2b739159219dab"
    },
    {
      "id": "c23e97d590719083305d05ef1e448285e43821452a7f98ce957917f896386af1",
      "text": "An Introduction To Plan Mode",
      "hash": "7a84f5a163a628fd891f9904f554a6429b0435ea8897649b90485aba2d455ec0"
    },
    {
      "id": "c0c160b36642f8931d080b7760e68415840dfc3b3f46cf8a18c961ee2f8d9a8e",
      "text": "Learn how plan mode transforms AI coding agents. Iterate on requirements before writing code, build context, and get better results from tools like Claude Code.",
      "hash": "f5750cb4c514d7bd2677c9a5445d6b5cc7b15d6473d195e62dc61c4d9e3f3fc0"
    },
    {
      "id": "2b959f0a07920ce736529ad346a1d5f13c5981baeae5e80a491303869b05fd07",
      "text": "Do this with",
      "hash": "a59a1c31949b5d94079d47f8327053bbea637de069174cc58f6aceb00cd1ddee"
    },
    {
      "id": "566cf18126e980a52f595cb8be427917170b0807e1bcbd2761eecafe0d9ef0d1",
      "text": "Set up one repo so the other skills know how it works.",
      "hash": "43e7aab494cb34b6e9f7a6b281e62e52bf5898d82737b0520106430ccdc8a78e"
    },
    {
      "id": "572f8db625750fad0ddb6193b8467b8668afb6abddc41169ac9b8df4bbb8fa17",
      "text": "More ways to set up your agent",
      "hash": "8b5470f14fa13884a09bea29d1580b0d06ddd47735b450d603ced39a4543c87e"
    },
    {
      "id": "351e1fcc128303d878ef6b37f33de4f9f0c20dfdf31ab5a626ea5e1da101fb2b",
      "text": "Already fluent with a coding agent? Sharpen the loop — grill your plans, fire tracer bullets, keep the context lean, and keep the architecture clean.",
      "hash": "f01a00b4a1db9baafac92d98cd7a61027491f51b7fa1206446e5c1c39d015739"
    },
    {
      "id": "cb996c1fb8a142f0d9f3d97050f3498c4a44328a02fcd11b05900b07f47551d6",
      "text": "5 Agent Skills I Use Every Day",
      "hash": "38b66930101519be8a7c752af1c16d848965c721f011fe95722590edf29f9481"
    },
    {
      "id": "ff8c8963a080b12e2f624d3ae606dcb7b01fc4f94e38fc11cd990f921e0313e2",
      "text": "Master AI code quality with proven engineering skills: prompt techniques, TDD, architecture design, and spec workflows for Claude Code agents.",
      "hash": "58de2c6c88ce25ab0d52b91f403d1cb62256bfd82a7dd4672400569adde862eb"
    },
    {
      "id": "65bb0b3285a133ae6d7c0f9f6888a8cefe2ca0e8d2fe5521d39a7df8b5fbcf68",
      "text": "Real-world feature build with Claude Code: every step explained",
      "hash": "0fe30f840117b4520c0ce377e3c153c186e0fa94332a946033ab45b08f76a1fe"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc9253b8f4eed54a8f312b947fa9b2ced5373d171d1aa078ee8a3ff65bc3ba97",
      "text": "Learn Claude Code workflow: grill sessions, PRDs, GitHub issues, AFK agents, and QA loops for building features efficiently with AI.",
      "hash": "aa9389345ab2b17958a021bf6039499c20bb276e549c95ecfd637ca250431c6b"
    },
    {
      "id": "50b7b3965ef491107975f2389c026f36b3adac92dc0522bd0da93c0d981e01d2",
      "text": "Tracer Bullets: Keeping AI Slop Under Control",
      "hash": "101bb0727324d9d69bceb21e311f6c1a249476cd67d543aa61741f8dea277187"
    },
    {
      "id": "c3e1fdcdbf055d345780d3a8bdcbafc49b1efba569d4c1dc5ad3838d43a8d6df",
      "text": "Learn how tracer bullets can help you control AI code quality by building small, end-to-end features and getting feedback early instead of bloated solutions.",
      "hash": "d6461f405d60c3273eb973e4474d7a7016d89fe1c5f7409e70a7765dc87d1d1b"
    },
    {
      "id": "d1cf6e43f650fc31eec57e4daf0733d1387c2be0572303a5afa6ba537717ec6f",
      "text": "Article · 4 min read",
      "hash": "8d437eb414a7fa8f57889d78f05cd08f83482d4f93356ba481096cf36d5469de"
    },
